+These are the four ORIGINAL registered presenter captures and inspection JSON
+from central `1020061231-9845` (1 passed in 13.05 seconds), source
+`54b9c1feeae01037fac64594824d2d3fd748a250`. Every byte is copied unchanged from
+`workers/vw-m3-mouth-capture-retention-fix/evidence` in the Timeline ORCH area.
+
+The original archive is `viewing-mouth-legacy-public-four-stills-v1.tgz`,
+10319 bytes, SHA256
+`e7f32e40aa1aa25d81f30d05fd5ccb83a8a19cd8ce4a5a560e9fd93dc73d7c39`.
+Its six members match these six retained files, including `sha256.json`.
+The regression pins the five original inspection/PNG hashes independently.
+
+Frames are exactly `[0,3,4,5]`; frame 0 and frame 4 naturally have identical
+bytes and remain two distinct actual captures. No frame was made, relabelled,
+resized, normalized or modified for this regression. Planted boundary controls
+use memory-only copies, never these files or replacements for a real frame.
+
+Scope: public10, the exact recorded Root props, explicit normalized mouth
+`151/104/19`, and its one actual picture cut. No default/partial/raw-invalid
+statistic equivalence, production source admission, private-math deletion or
+Gate 6 qualification is claimed. Existing public known diagnostics stay known.
